/E (Our executive team worked diligently to ensure that all events aligned with our mission of fostering career growth, skill-building, and meaningful connections for undergraduate students. The year was marked by impactful milestones, including hosting TMU alumni, CPR workshops, a major conference featuring professors from the University of Waterloo and University of Toronto, and hands-on project-based opportunities. With clear leadership roles, active general membership, and strong planning through executive and general body meetings, BMES TMU has made significant strides in representing and serving the biomedical engineering community at our university.)
