<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Throughout the year, BMES TMU has organized a variety of activities focused on fostering community engagement, professional development, and collaboration with external organizations. Our events have ranged from networking opportunities with industry professionals to interactive social activities aimed at building connections among students. Notable highlights include the BMES Conference 2025, which featured industry professionals and entrepreneurial students, and the "Rest & Reset" event, which provided stress relief for students before final exams. These activities were complemented by our community outreach and fundraising efforts to support local organizations and promote awareness about important causes.)
