<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Due to the limited number of BMES student chapters within Canada, we were unable to conduct any formal inter-chapter activities this year. Despite this challenge, we made efforts to connect with other BMES chapters through social media platforms, particularly Instagram, to begin establishing relationships. These initial interactions have opened the door for potential collaborations, and we are currently exploring virtual and online opportunities to engage students across chapters in the future. Our goal is to facilitate accessible and meaningful inter-chapter events that strengthen the broader BMES student community, regardless of geographical limitations.)
