443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (BMES TMU focused on outreach initiatives aimed at engaging with the broader community, raising awareness, and contributing to charitable causes. Our events connected students to local organizations, supported public awareness campaigns, and made a tangible impact through fundraising. From tabling at large-scale events to running charity fundraisers, we ensured students were both informed and involved. These initiatives created meaningful touchpoints between BMES and the wider TMU student body, while also reinforcing our commitment to community impact. Each event was designed with inclusivity and student engagement in mind, allowing us to foster stronger connections with first-year students, prospective applicants, and external organizations. In addition to increasing our visibility, our outreach helped showcase the value of biomedical engineering in everyday contexts and promoted BMES as a welcoming space for all students interested in innovation, healthcare, and technology.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
