<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To date, BMES at Toronto Metropolitan University has not had the opportunity to attend the National BMES Annual Meeting. As a relatively new and growing chapter, our participation has been limited due to funding and logistical constraints, particularly with regard to international travel.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (However, we recognize the immense value that the National Meeting offers in terms of professional development, research exposure, and networking with peers and industry leaders in biomedical engineering. Currently, our executive team is actively in discussions with the Department of Biomedical Engineering to secure funding and institutional support to enable our members to attend future Annual Meetings.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
